SUMMARY:Jam For Good Presents The Lichy Nuts w/ Jon Gonzales and Andrew Wol
 
ff
LOCATION:Hill Country Live\, Midtown South-Flatiron-Union Square
DESCRIPTION:The Lichy Nuts are three brothers from New York --- Abe\, Josh\
 
, and David Lichy --- playing a molten mix of jamband rock\, funk\, electro
 
nica\, and psychedelia\, covers and originals held loosely. For this one-ni
 
ght-only show they're joined by Jon Gonzales and Andrew Wolff. The Nuts don
 
't tour and don't keep a schedule\; they convene every few years\, plug in\
 
, and see where it goes. Don't forget your night shades. Jam For Good is a 
 
501(c)(3) nonprofit supporting kids with cancer through live music. Net pro
 
ceeds stay local to support kids and their families being cared for at MSK 
 
Kids in NYC. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/jam-for-good-p
 
resents-the-hill-country-live-tickets/14342614
