SUMMARY:Salcedo's Latin Soul: Pops y Palmas
LOCATION:LeFrak Concert Hall at Kupferberg Center for the Arts\, Queensboro
 
 Hill
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the release of Pops y Palmas\, the new album from Ste
 
ven Salcedo and Salcedo's Latin Soul. Inspired by the question\, "What if L
 
ouis Armstrong had toured the Caribbean?"\, this vibrant project explores t
 
he musical connections between New Orleans jazz and the traditions of the D
 
ominican Republic\, Haiti\, Cuba\, and Puerto Rico. Blending Afro-Caribbean
 
 rhythms\, soulful melodies\, and joyful improvisation\, Pops y Palmas offe
 
rs a fresh and exciting tribute to the shared cultural roots that unite the
 
se musical worlds. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/salcedos-la
 
